TITLE:: SympathyView
summary:: Sympathy's display
categories:: Libraries>Sympathy
related:: Classes/Sympathy, Classes/FxParamView, Classes/FxParamPanel

DESCRIPTION::
What link::Classes/FxParamPanel:: puts at the top of Sympathy's window. In it, drag a voice along the keyboard for its note, up and down for its level (shift for quarter tones and finer); the wheel moves the root and everything with it.

It draws from the object's settings and the replies its meters bring, so it is only live while the window is running; link::Classes/FxParamView:: has the rest.

